      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midvale%2C_Idaho"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "A post office and school opened in 1876, followed by the Middle Valley Ditch in 1884, the first store in 1885, and the railroad in 1898.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
