        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Midvale%2C_Idaho"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Every summer, Midvale hosts an Antique Tractor Pull that starts behind the school at 2:00 p.m.",
